  "id": "banana-cupcakes-with-chocolate-chips-and-cream-cheese-frosting",
  "name": "Banana Cupcakes with Chocolate Chips and Cream Cheese Frosting",
  "subtitle": "Tender banana cupcakes finished with a smooth tangy frosting",
  "description": "Mashed ripe bananas and chocolate chips add flavor and texture to these lightly sweet cupcakes, topped after cooling with cream cheese frosting.",
